bluejetty:00088386:ios.description:
Professional to provide high-quality telephone recording, call recording service, anytime and anywhere to record the call content, recording is so simple!
-Fresh interface, simple operation, one click recording;
-Silent recording, protect your privacy;
-Access the recording immediately after the call;
-It is easy to manage and rename the recording for identification;
-Recording can be easily exported with one click;
-Support sharing with other devices;
-There is no limit on the number of recordings;
-High fidelity call recording, remove noise, output high quality recording files for you;
-It has rich functions, strong applicability and adapts to various scenes,
-High reliable encrypted storage, safe and worry free;
-Strong applicability, professional forensics, one key preservation of evidence;
